#: ui/ComponentOverlay.qml:98
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label %1 is a MIME type and %2 is an application name"
msgid "%1 (Currently opens in %2)"
msgstr "%1 (በአሁኑ ጊዜ በ%2 ይከፈታል)"

#: ui/ComponentOverlay.qml:111
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button %1 is an application name"
msgid "Open All in %1"
msgstr "ሁሉንም በ%1 ክፈት"

#: ui/ComponentOverlay.qml:130
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This application does not advertise support for the following file types, "
"but may be able to open them anyway:"
msgstr "ይህ መተግበሪያ ለሚከተሉት የፋይል አይነቶች ድጋፍ አያስተዋውቅም፣ ነገር ግን ሊከፍታቸው ይችላል፦"

#: ui/ComponentOverlay.qml:147
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Force All to Open in %1"
msgstr "ሁሉም በ%1 እንዲከፈት አስገድድ"

#: ui/ComponentOverlay.qml:159
#, kde-format
msgid "Configure Manually…"
msgstr "በእጅ አዋቅር…"

#: ui/main.qml:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"’%1’ seems to not support the following mimetypes associated with this kind "
"of application: %2"
msgstr ""
"'%1' ከዚህ አይነት መተግበሪያ ጋር የተያያዙ የሚከተሉትን የማይም አይነቶችን (mimetypes) የማይደግፍ ይመስላል፦ "
"%2"

#: ui/main.qml:34
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status"
msgid "This application may not be able to open all file types."
msgstr "ይህ መተግበሪያ ሁሉንም የፋይል አይነቶችን መክፈት ላይችል ይችላል።"

